## Discovery Phase Checkpoint

**Before moving to Phase 2, you must have:**

✅ Project charter drafted and sent to sponsor  
✅ Business question clearly defined  
✅ Deliverable format and audience identified  
✅ Scope boundaries documented  
✅ Timeline agreed upon  
✅ No code written yet (this is correct!)  

**Red flag:** If your sponsor hasn't responded to your charter by Day 3, follow up. Don't proceed without alignment.

