- [Issue 2: e.g., "Month-end reports may have incomplete data"]

**Resolution:**
[How we're handling these issues]

---

**Change History:**

| Date | Change | Reason | Changed By |
|------|--------|--------|------------|
| [Date] | [What changed] | [Why] | [Name] |

---

**Questions & Clarifications:**

| Question | Answer | Answered By | Date |
|----------|--------|-------------|------|
