# Phase 3: Develop {#phase-3-develop}

**Duration:** Week 2-4

**Goal:** Build the analysis iteratively with weekly stakeholder check-ins

**Key Outputs:** Working analysis, draft deliverable

**Rule:** Show work-in-progress weekly, incorporate feedback early

---

## Why Iterative Development Matters

**Common mistake:** Work in isolation for 3 weeks, then present finished product

