#### Presentation Tips:

**DO:**
- ✅ Start with the answer (don't make them wait)
- ✅ Tell a story, not just show data
- ✅ Speak to business impact, not technical details
- ✅ Pause for questions throughout
- ✅ End with clear next steps

**DON'T:**
- ❌ Read slides verbatim
- ❌ Apologize for limitations (state them matter-of-factly)
- ❌ Dive into technical details unless asked
- ❌ Use jargon or acronyms without explaining
- ❌ Go over time

